    <description><![CDATA[<h2 id="application_controllerrb-코드-추가">application_controller.rb 코드 추가</h2>
<p>application_controller.rb에 아래 사항 추가</p>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
